----------------------------------Release 1.0.0----------------------------------
2026-6-29	tehw0lf
	* Rebranded to WoWQuote2 (fork of WoWQuote2 v0.9c)
	* Added /wq2 as additional slash command alias for the UI
	* Added WOTLK support (Interface: 30300)
	* Added Vanilla (Interface: 11200) and TBC (Interface: 20400) as separate build targets
	* Added localization support for English (base/fallback), French, Dutch, Spanish (esES/esMX) and Portuguese (ptBR)
	* German localization now properly guarded by GetLocale() check
	* All locales define WQcategories with translated category names
	* Category definitions in media_data.lua support per-locale translations
	* Added GitHub Actions release pipeline (builds empty addon ZIPs on push to main)
	* Releases are now sound-free (bring your own sounds via WoWQuote-Manager)
	* Set Guild as default broadcast channel
	* Build script now generates release ZIPs without requiring new uploads


